# NLP/ and RBP/ must NOT be excluded -- both are imported at runtime:
#   NLP/main_NLP.py  entrypoint of the always-on NLP ECS service
#   RBP/             imported by src/orchestrator/rbp_runner.py and
#                    src/portfolios/portfolio_8/strategy.py. There is no
#                    src/RBP fallback, so excluding it also broke the market
#                    task: rbp_runner died on import and start.sh took the
#                    other market scripts down with it.
#
# Scraped article bodies are persisted to the database, so the local copies are
# build-time weight only (~2.3 MB) and are not read by the running container.
# NLP/fetch_state is deliberately NOT excluded -- it is small (~44 KB) and the
# pipeline reads it to resume incremental fetches.
NLP/articles/
NLP/articles/**
